title: The Wishing Font
portrait left: seeker

A stone basin of clear water in a room that has no business having clear water. Coins on the bottom. Some of them are very old.

choice:
  - [if gold >= 50] Throw in 50 gold -> wish
  - Leave -> leave

@wish
  > gold -50
  > card add random uncommon
  Ripples. Then, floating up, something that was not there before.
  > end

@leave
  You keep your coins. The water keeps its secrets.
  > end
